3 Output Format
***************

The default (human-readable) output format per entry is:

     PERCENTAGE%  COUNT VALUE

   Percentages below 10 are padded with a leading space so decimal
points align.  The count column is right-justified to the width of the
largest count.

   CSV output (‘-c’ or ‘-a’):

     PERCENTAGE%,COUNT,VALUE

   The final line in either format is:

       Total:  N

   When ‘--min’ or ‘--max’ filtering is active and excluded entries
exist, an additional ‘[excluded]’ line appears before the total (unless
‘--ignore’ suppresses it).


